      "id": "claim_8edd1029dc824192be1edda145a82f4a",
      "statement": "Catapulze Job Intelligence is a Bun monorepo under the @ji workspace scope; the workspace packages and their roles are documented in AGENTS.md: apps/web is the Next.js UI on port 3001, apps/server is the Hono + tRPC API on port 3000, packages/api holds the tRPC router, packages/application is the use-case layer, packages/auth is Better Auth, packages/connectors is the connector/source-adapter layer, packages/db is Drizzle + postgres-js, packages/domain is the shared types core, and packages/search is the Manticore engine/adapter.",
